ANS: B 
Delegation is the transfer of responsibility for performing a task to another person while the nurse 
who delegated the task remains accountable. Obtaining vital signs, bathing, and ambulating are all 
tasks associated with the assessment part of the nursing process. The nursing process cannot be 
delegated. 
 
